
# Vehicle Transportation Management System (VTMS)





Department of Computer Science
Namal University, Mianwali

---

## Project Overview

The Vehicle Transportation Management System (VTMS) is a comprehensive transportation management platform developed using modern web technologies and a fully normalized relational database design. The system automates shipment processing, fleet management, payment handling, invoice generation, delivery verification, and company logistics operations.

The system replaces traditional manual record-keeping with a centralized database-driven platform that supports vehicle booking, shipment tracking, billing, secure payments, and administrative control.

