# **Database Components**

### Core Entities (15 Tables)

| Entity | Description |
| ------ | ----------- |
| User | System users with role-based access |
| Driver | Driver information and records |
| Company | Transport company details |
| EndCustomer | Customer information |
| VehicleCategory | Vehicle type classification |
| Vehicle | Fleet vehicle registry |
| Truck | Truck-specific attributes |
| Shipment | Shipment details and tracking |
| DriverAssignment | Driver-vehicle assignment records |
| Agreement | Service agreements |
| Invoice | Billing invoices |
| Payment | Payment transactions |
| DeliveryVerification | Proof of delivery |
| ShipmentStatusLog | Status change history |
| CancellationRequest | Order cancellation requests |

---

# **Database Automation**

## Implemented Triggers (19)

<details>
<summary><b>📋 Click to View Complete Trigger List</b></summary>

| # | Trigger Name | Purpose |
| - | ------------ | ------- |
| 1 | trg_generate_tracking_id | Auto-generates unique tracking IDs for shipments |
| 2 | trg_generate_invoice_number | Creates sequential invoice numbers |
| 3 | trg_calculate_delivery_charges | Computes delivery charges based on distance |
| 4 | trg_create_delivery_verification | Creates delivery verification record |
| 5 | trg_prevent_status_regression | Prevents backward status changes |
| 6 | trg_log_shipment_status | Logs all status changes to history |
| 7 | trg_update_vehicle_status | Updates vehicle availability status |
| 8 | trg_update_driver_status | Updates driver availability status |
| 9 | trg_update_truck_status_on_assignment | Updates truck status when assigned |
| 10 | trg_truck_load_on_shipment_assign | Manages truck load capacity on assignment |
| 11 | trg_truck_load_on_shipment_done | Updates truck load on completion |
| 12 | trg_block_full_truck_assignment | Prevents assignment to full trucks |
| 13 | trg_auto_generate_invoice | Automatically generates invoice on shipment creation |
| 14 | trg_deduct_wallet_balance | Deducts wallet balance for payments |
| 15 | trg_block_inactive_company_shipment | Blocks shipments for inactive companies |
| 16 | trg_notify_admin_new_company | Alerts admin on new company registration |
| 17 | trg_calculate_cancellation_charge | Calculates cancellation fees |
| 18 | trg_apply_cancellation_on_approval | Processes cancellation upon approval |
| 19 | trg_notify_finance_cod_payment | Notifies finance department for COD payments |

</details>

---

## Implemented Stored Procedures (4)

| Procedure | Purpose |
| --------- | ------- |
| sp_update_user_password | Updates Admin/Transport Manager/Finance Manager passwords |
| sp_update_company_password | Updates Company account password |
| sp_resolve_cancellation | Processes cancellation requests with fee calculation |
| sp_approve_cod_payment | Approves Cash on Delivery payments |

---

# **OpenRouteService Integration**

The system integrates **OpenRouteService API** for:

- Route Generation between pickup and delivery locations
- Distance Calculation for accurate pricing
- Delivery Cost Computation based on distance and vehicle type
- Transportation Planning optimization

The API was selected because it provides reliable routing functionality without the cost limitations associated with commercial GPS APIs.

---

# **Security Features**

- Password Hashing using bcrypt
- Authentication Controls for role-based access
- Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) – Admin, Transport Manager, Finance Manager, Company, Customer
- Input Validation on all API endpoints
- Secure Database Access with connection pooling
- Protected API Endpoints with JWT authentication

